IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il-interpretation-time`
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g2-validity`
IMPORT `g2-conditions`
IMPORT `g2-temporary-licence`

-- g2-renewal.l4: the second limb of section 8 of the Regulation of Engagement in Work on Refrigeration or Air-Conditioning
-- Systems Law 5785-2025 (renewal "on the conditions of s 6 except s 6(a)(4)"), and the composition that the other groups
-- consume as "the conditions of the licence still hold" (integration point IP18: s 10(a)(2) of the Law takes the loss of a
-- condition under s 6 or s 9 as a ground).
--
-- IMPORTS.  prelude, daydate, il-interpretation-time, domain, and the group's own g2-validity, g2-conditions and
-- g2-temporary-licence.  No other group's module.
--
-- FORK FR1 (trap T26, groups G1 and G2).  s 6(a) says the Registrar SHALL grant a licence to an applicant who meets the conditions;
-- s 8 says a licence CAN be renewed when the s 6 conditions (except (a)(4)) hold, and says nothing of who renews or of a duty;
-- s 10(a) says the Registrar MAY, on six grounds, refuse to renew.  TAKEN: s 8's second limb states WHEN a licence can be
-- renewed (a boolean test: the passive "can be renewed" is an eligibility test, not a permission and not a duty), and leaves the
-- Registrar's duty or discretion to ss 5 and 10.  ALTERNATIVE: s 8 read as a duty like s 6(a), displaced only by a ground under
-- s 10(a) (s 10 the special rule), so that an eligible licensee against whom no ground applies must be renewed.
-- The fee for a renewal (regulation 2(c), regulation 4 of the Fees Regulations, group G8) is not asked here.

§ `Section 8 — renewal on the conditions of section 6, except (a)(4)`

-- "...and it can be renewed for further validity periods when the conditions under s 6 are met, except the condition under
-- subsection (a)(4) of that section."
-- src:100 | {{ח:ת}} תוקפו של רישיון יהיה לחמש שנים או עד 31 במרץ של השנה החמישית מהשנה שבה ניתן הרישיון, לפי המוקדם (להלן – תקופת תוקף), וניתן לחדשו לתקופות תוקף נוספות בהתקיים התנאים לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 6|סעיף 6}}, למעט התנאי לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 6|סעיף קטן (א)(4) של אותו סעיף}}.
@ref s 8: renewal on the conditions of s 6 except s 6(a)(4) (src:100)
GIVEN application IS AN Application
      `in the Registrar's opinion an offence the applicant was convicted of or is charged with makes the applicant unfit to be a licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 8 — the licence can be renewed for the applicant` application `in the Registrar's opinion an offence the applicant was convicted of or is charged with makes the applicant unfit to be a licensee` MEANS
        `s 6(a)(1) — the applicant is of full age` application
    AND `s 6(a)(2) — the applicant is an Israeli citizen or resident` application
    AND `s 6(a)(3) — no disqualifying conviction or pending indictment` application `in the Registrar's opinion an offence the applicant was convicted of or is charged with makes the applicant unfit to be a licensee`

-- FR1, the alternative: s 8 read as a duty, displaced only by a ground under s 10(a).
@ref s 8: renewal on the conditions of s 6 except s 6(a)(4), read as a duty (src:100)
GIVEN application IS AN Application
      `in the Registrar's opinion an offence the applicant was convicted of or is charged with makes the applicant unfit to be a licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a ground for refusing to renew applies under section 10(a)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under section 6`
`s 8 (read as a duty) — the Registrar must renew the licence` application `in the Registrar's opinion an offence the applicant was convicted of or is charged with makes the applicant unfit to be a licensee` `a ground for refusing to renew applies under section 10(a)` MEANS
    IF       `s 8 — the licence can be renewed for the applicant` application `in the Registrar's opinion an offence the applicant was convicted of or is charged with makes the applicant unfit to be a licensee`
         AND NOT `a ground for refusing to renew applies under section 10(a)`
    THEN PARTY `the Registrar`
         MUST `grant the licence sought` (application's `the kind of licence sought`)
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `Section 10(a)(2) with sections 6 and 9 — the conditions of the licence still hold`

-- IP18.  s 10(a)(2) names the case where "a condition for the grant of the licence under ss 6 or 9, as the case may be,
-- ceased to hold".  For a licence under s 6 the conditions that can cease are (1) to (3); (4) is a past training and is not
-- re-asked, as s 8 does not re-ask it on renewal.  For a temporary licence the conditions of s 9(a) are asked again.
@ref s 10(a)(2) read with ss 6 and 8: the conditions for the grant of a licence under s 6 still hold (src:100)
GIVEN application IS AN Application
      `in the Registrar's opinion an offence the applicant was convicted of or is charged with makes the applicant unfit to be a licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the conditions of a licence under section 6 still hold` application `in the Registrar's opinion an offence the applicant was convicted of or is charged with makes the applicant unfit to be a licensee` MEANS
    `s 8 — the licence can be renewed for the applicant` application `in the Registrar's opinion an offence the applicant was convicted of or is charged with makes the applicant unfit to be a licensee`

-- src:103 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} על אף האמור {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 6|בסעיפים 6}} {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 8|ו־8}}, הרשם רשאי לתת רישיון דרגה 3 זמני, למבקש ממדינת חוץ שמתקיימים לגביו התנאים המנויים להלן (בסעיף זה – מומחה זר), לתקופה שלא תעלה על שנה (בסעיף זה – רישיון זמני):
@ref s 10(a)(2) read with s 9(a): the conditions for the grant of a temporary licence still hold (src:103)
GIVEN expert IS A `Foreign expert's application under section 9`
      `in the Registrar's opinion the expert is of repute and a renowned expert in the field` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the conditions of a licence under section 9 still hold` expert `in the Registrar's opinion the expert is of repute and a renowned expert in the field` MEANS
    `s 9(a) — the applicant is a foreign expert meeting conditions (1) to (3)` expert `in the Registrar's opinion the expert is of repute and a renowned expert in the field`

@ref s 10(a)(2), the licence's own conditions: section 6 for an ordinary licence, section 9 for a temporary licence (src:100)
@export Whether the conditions on which the licence was granted still hold: for a licence under s 6, the conditions of s 6(a)(1) to (3) (the training of s 6(a)(4) is not re-asked); for a temporary licence under s 9, the conditions of s 9(a) (G1 takes the negation as `a condition for the grant ceased to hold`)
GIVEN licence IS A Licence @desc The licence as the register records it
      `the conditions of a licence under section 6 still hold` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the holder still meets s 6(a)(1) to (3)
      `the conditions of a licence under section 9 still hold` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the holder still meets s 9(a)(1) to (3) as a foreign expert
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the conditions of the licence still hold` licence `the conditions of a licence under section 6 still hold` `the conditions of a licence under section 9 still hold` MEANS
    IF   licence's `a temporary licence under section 9`
    THEN `the conditions of a licence under section 9 still hold`
    ELSE `the conditions of a licence under section 6 still hold`
